{"id":"87c08292-1d0d-447f-a529-a8fda45a5fd8","object":"response","created_at":1792378512,"status":"completed","background":false,"completed_at":1792378514,"content_filters":null,"error":null,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"incomplete_details":null,"instructions":null,"max_output_tokens":4096,"max_tool_calls":null,"model":"deepseek-flash","moderation":null,"output":[{"type":"message","id":"0c44df52-e31d-4957-b0e8-2b46be14fd9c","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"output_text","annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"{\"resource_type\":\"exercise\",\"prompt_version\":\"learning-resources-v1\",\"content\":{\"items\":[{\"id\":\"q1\",\"question\":\"[单选题] 在头插法中，设 new_node 为新节点、head 为头指针，下列哪组语句顺序正确？\\nA. head = new_node; new_node->next = head;\\nB. new_node->next = head; head = new_node;\\nC. new_node->next = NULL; head = new_node->next;\\nD. head->next = new_node; head = new_node;\\n仅填 A、B、C 或 D\",\"answer\":\"B\",\"explanation\":\"必须先让新节点的 next 指向原链表（new_node->next = head），再让 head 指向新节点。若先执行 head = new_node，原链表的头就丢失了。\"},{\"id\":\"q2\",\"question\":\"[判断题] 从空链表 head -> NULL 开始，依次用头插法插入 1、2、3，遍历打印得到的输出是 3 2 1。仅填 T 或 F（T=正确，F=错误）\",\"answer\":\"T\",\"explanation\":\"头插法每次把新节点放在最前面，最终链表为 head -> [3] -> [2] -> [1] -> NULL，遍历顺序是 3 2 1，与插入顺序相反。\"},{\"id\":\"q3\",\"question\":\"[单选题] 从空链表 head -> NULL 开始，依次用头插法插入 1、2、3 后，head 指向的节点数据域是什么？\\nA. 1\\nB. 2\\nC. 3\\nD. NULL\\n仅填 A、B、C 或 D\",\"answer\":\"C\",\"explanation\":\"头插法使最后插入的节点成为第一个节点，因此 head 指向数据为 3 的节点，链表为 head -> [3] -> [2] -> [1] -> NULL。\"}]}}"}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":null,"reasoning":{"effort":"none","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":0.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"edumind_result","schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["resource_type","prompt_version","content"],"properti